  situationName: A Late Traveller Passes By
  act: Keep watching the road and nearby ground from camp for a while longer.
  situationDescription: After a long wait, a cautious traveller emerges from the
    same direction as the earlier human sounds and follows the road past camp at
    a distance. They never approach, but the goods on their cart and the direction
    they are heading give you a useful clue about trade conditions on the road ahead.
